{{also|Equus}}
==Latin==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|la|equos}} ''(Republican spelling)''
* {{l|la|ecus}} ''(phonetic spelling, respelt in post-Augustan times as ''equus'' on the analogy of oblique cases)

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|h₁eḱ}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*ekwos}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*h₁éḱwos||horse}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc|ἵππος}}, {{cog|sa|अश्व|tr=áśva}}, {{cog|fa|اسب|tr=æsb}}, {{cog|xcl|էշ||donkey}}, {{cog|txb|yakwe}}, {{cog|cel-gau|epos}}.

